        103.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        404.4255676269531,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "bedaquiline, using phenotypic DST as the reference standard;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        95.91809844970703,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        387.2875671386719,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "linezolid, using phenotypic DST as the reference standard;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        95.91809844970703,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        402.3464660644531,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "clofazimine, using phenotypic DST as the reference standard;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        95.91809844970703,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        146.66119384765625,
        389.7958679199219,
        159.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "amikacin, using phenotypic DST as the reference standard;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        95.91809844970703,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        162.16119384765625,
        517.4769287109375,
        175.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "ethambutol, using a composite reference standard of phenotypic DST and WGS; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        177.66119384765625,
        409.870361328125,
        190.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "streptomycin, using phenotypic DST as the reference standard.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        177.69419860839844,
        93.36609649658203,
        190.91619873046875
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "MyriadPro-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.66522216796875,
        526.952880859375,
        214.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "A broad search was conducted to find, appraise and synthesize evidence about health benefits",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.980082511901855,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.16522216796875,
        526.9920043945312,
        230.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "and the diagnostic test accuracy of targeted NGS compared with phenotypic drug sensitivity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        232.66522216796875,
        526.9561767578125,
        245.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "testing for patients with bacteriologically confirmed TB or with bacteriologically confirmed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.16522216796875,
        527.1997680664062,
        261.31024169921875
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin-resistant pulmonary TB disease. A comprehensive search of three databases (Medline,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        263.66522216796875,
        526.64306640625,
        276.81024169921875
      ],
      "text": "Ovid Embase and Scopus) for relevant citations was performed. No date restriction was applied",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.970961570739746,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.16522216796875,
        527.2003173828125,
        292.31024169921875
      ],
      "text": "and the search was initially performed on 7 September 2022 and repeated on 17 January 2023.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.966599464416504,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        294.66522216796875,
        526.9644165039062,
        307.81024169921875
      ],
      "text": "In addition, WHO made a public call for data and contacted well-known experts in the field to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        310.16522216796875,
        435.84124755859375,
        323.31024169921875
      ],
      "text": "ask whether they had, or knew of, unpublished data that could contribute.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        334.1690979003906,
        526.96435546875,
        347.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "No data were found for the impact of targeted NGS on patient-level health effects. For the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.6690979003906,
        527.2928466796875,
        362.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "analysis of diagnostic accuracy, because few data were available in the literature, all data",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.1690979003906,
        527.2484130859375,
        378.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "identified from the literature were included after correspondence with the authors. Hence,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        380.6690979003906,
        526.6839599609375,
        393.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "no manual data extraction from publications was required. A post-hoc decision was made",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.1690979003906,
        526.8052368164062,
        409.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "to perform only an individual patient data (IPD) meta-analysis; thus, any study that could",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        411.6690979003906,
        526.6950073242188,
        424.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "not provide IPD was excluded. Two report authors made independent assessments of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.1690979003906,
        527.2341918945312,
        440.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "methodological quality using QUADAS-2. Disagreements were resolved by discussion and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        442.6690979003906,
        450.3052062988281,
        455.8141174316406
      ],
      "text": "uncertainties or disagreements were reviewed by an independent third party.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        466.6730041503906,
        527.0911865234375,
        479.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "Subanalyses were performed to assess the diagnostic test accuracy in PLHIV and for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        482.1535949707031,
        526.9615478515625,
        495.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "® ® semiquantitative results (derived from cycle thresholds) from Xpert MTB/RIF  or Xpert Ultra ,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        497.6730041503906,
        526.8904418945312,
        510.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "where “very low” or “low” concentrations of   were compared with “medium” or  M. tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977777481079102,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        513.1729736328125,
        527.28515625,
        526.3179931640625
      ],
      "text": "“high” concentrations. The very low or low semiquantitative categories represent paucibacillary",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.958169937133789,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        528.6729736328125,
        390.2129211425781,
        541.8179931640625
      ],
      "text": "disease states, such as those frequently observed in paediatric TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        552.6768798828125,
        526.9810180664062,
        565.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "Data were included from both published and unpublished prospective, observational clinical",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        568.1768798828125,
        527.1278686523438,
        581.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "studies of targeted NGS platform diagnostic accuracy. All studies where targeted NGS had been",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.9572172164917,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        583.6768798828125,
        526.9756469726562,
        596.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "performed directly from processed clinical samples were included, whereas those performed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        599.1768798828125,
        527.0032348632812,
        612.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "exclusively on cultured isolates were excluded. All studies were required to have comparator",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        614.6768798828125,
        526.947998046875,
        627.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "phenotypic DST data as a reference; in the cases of rifampicin, ethambutol and pyrazinamide,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        630.1768798828125,
        526.7051391601562,
        643.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "studies were required to also have WGS, to allow a composite reference to be generated.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        645.6575317382812,
        525.8972778320312,
        658.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "® ®  Rifampicin resistance results and semiquantitative results from Xpert MTB/RIF  or Xpert Ultra",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        661.1768798828125,
        227.9001007080078,
        674.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "were requested from all studies.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        685.180908203125,
        526.8931884765625,
        698.325927734375
      ],
      "text": "Given that this was a review of the diagnostic accuracy of a class of diagnostic platforms, all",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        700.680908203125,
        526.904052734375,
        713.825927734375
      ],
      "text": "the data from each platform alone were analysed to assess which to include in an analysis to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        716.180908203125,
        527.1901245117188,
        729.325927734375
      ],
      "text": "inform a class recommendation. Where the performance of any one platform appeared to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        731.680908203125,
        524.41162109375,
        744.825927734375
      ],
      "text": "be an outlier for sensitivity or specificity, that platform was excluded from subsequent meta-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        747.180908203125,
        526.9039306640625,
        760.325927734375
      ],
      "text": "analyses. A platform was considered to be an outlier for a particular drug if the point estimate",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.466400146484375,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "104 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}